      "message": "This is required because zero sized buffers have size zero but allocated size 4 from [this](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/vulkan/BufferVk.cpp;l\u003d246;drc\u003d0d7807d5637f6d09b72f7909318da0e3d2ad5590) but we don\u0027t actually map them [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/Buffer.cpp;l\u003d521;drc\u003dcaac5277edaa28d7556597dc0569c186eb2f2660) and memset will crash trying to write to that memory. The [existing InitializeToZero()](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/vulkan/BufferVk.cpp;l\u003d812-836;drc\u003d0d7807d5637f6d09b72f7909318da0e3d2ad5590) clears the whole allocated size so I kept that the same. I don\u0027t know if it matters or if using GetSize() in memset() would be better.",
